ation:mfLine .9s cubic-bezier(.16,1,.3,1) .3s both\"><\u002Fspan>\n      <span style=\"font-family:'Space Mono',monospace;font-size:11px;letter-spacing:.22em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#4fb98d\">Gravado por mim, na minha mão<\u002Fspan>\n    <\u002Fdiv>\n\n    <h1 style=\"font-family:'Bebas Neue',sans-serif;font-weight:400;font-size:max(52px,min(13.5vw,190px,19vh));line-height:.86;text-align:right;width:100%;letter-spacing:.005em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#eef2ee;max-width:1180px\">\n      <span style=\"display:block;overflow:hidden;padding-top:.2em;margin-top:-.2em\"><span style=\"display:block;animation:mfRise 1.05s cubic-bezier(.16,1,.3,1) .4s both\">Importado<\u002Fspan><\u002Fspan>\n      <span style=\"display:block;overflow:hidden;padding-top:.2em;margin-top:-.2em\"><span style=\"display:block;animation:mfRise 1.05s cubic-bezier(.16,1,.3,1) .52s both\">de verdade,<\u002Fspan><\u002Fspan>\n      <span style=\"display:block;overflow:hidden;padding-top:.2em;margin-top:-.2em\"><span style=\"display:block;color:#4fb98d;animation:mfRise 1.05s cubic-bezier(.16,1,.3,1) .64s both\">na sua mão.<\u002Fspan><\u002Fspan>\n    <\u002Fh1>\n\n    <div style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;align-items:flex-end;justify-content:flex-end;width:100%;gap:clamp(20px,4vw,48px);border-top:1px solid rgba(238,242,238,.14);padding-top:clamp(18px,2.6vh,26px);animation:mfFade 1s ease .82s both\">\n      <p style=\"max-width:44ch;text-align:right;font-size:clamp(14.5px,1.5vw,17px);line-height:1.6;color:#c3ccc6;font-weight:300\">Eu escolho cada peça, tiro cada foto e respondo o WhatsApp eu mesmo. Se um par não passa na minha mão, ele não entra no site.<\u002Fp>\n      <div style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:12px\">\n        <a href=\"https://wa.me/5538997506508?text=Oi%21%20Vim%20pelo%20site%20da%20MF%20Sportswear%20e%20quero%20saber%20mais.\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;min-height:52px;padding:0 30px;border-radius:99