<\u002Fsvg>\n    Tocar o vídeo\n  <\u002Fbutton>\n\n  <div id=\"mfScrollHint\" style=\"position:absolute;left:clamp(16px,4vw,40px);top:50%;transform:translateY(-50%);display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;gap:12px;animation:mfFade 1s ease 1.1s both\">\n    <span style=\"font-family:'Space Mono',monospace;font-size:10px;letter-spacing:.24em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#93a099;writing-mode:vertical-rl\">Role<\u002Fspan>\n    <span style=\"width:1px;height:52px;background:linear-gradient(to bottom,#4fb98d,transparent);animation:mfBob 2.6s ease-in-out infinite\"><\u002Fspan>\n  <\u002Fdiv>\n<\u002Fsection>\n\n<div style=\"border-top:1px solid rgba(238,242,238,.09);border-bottom:1px solid rgba(238,242,238,.09);background:#0b0f0c;overflow:hidden;padding:15px 0\">\n  <div style=\"display:flex;width:max-content;animation:mfSlide 34s linear infinite;font-family:'Space Mono',monospace;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:.2em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#4fb98d\">\n    <span style=\"display:flex;gap:34px;padding-right:34px\"><span>Envio para todo o Brasil<\u002Fspan><span style=\"color:#2e5e49\">◆<\u002Fspan><span>Rastreio em toda compra<\u002Fspan><span style=\"color:#2e5e49\">◆<\u002Fspan><span>Foto real antes de pagar<\u002Fspan><span style=\"color:#2e5e49\">◆<\u002Fspan><span>Atendimento direto com o Matheus<\u002Fspan><span style=\"color:#2e5e49\">◆<\u002Fspan><\u002Fspan>\n    <span style=\"display:flex;gap:34px;padding-right:34px\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span>Envio para todo o Brasil<\u002Fspan><span style=\"color:#2e5e49\">◆<\u002Fspan><span>Rastreio em toda compra<\u002Fspan><span style=\"color:#2e5e49\">◆<\u002Fspan><span>Foto real antes de pagar<\u002Fspan><span style=\"color:#2e5e49\">◆<\u002Fspan><span>Atendimento direto com o Matheus<\u002Fspan><span style=\"color:#2e5e49\">◆<\u002Fspan><\u002Fspan>\n  <\u002Fdiv>\n<\u002Fdiv>\n\n<section id=\"tenis\" style=\"padding:clamp(64px,10vw,132px) clamp(16px,4vw,40px) clamp(40px,6vw,72px);max-width:1440px;m