o',monospace;font-size:11px;letter-spacing:.18em;color:#5f6f66\">001<\u002Fspan>\n          <h3 style=\"margin-top:8px;font-family:'Bebas Neue',sans-serif;font-weight:400;font-size:clamp(28px,3.6vw,46px);line-height:1;letter-spacing:.01em;text-transform:uppercase\">Nike Air Zoom Alphafly 3<\u002Fh3>\n          <p style=\"margin-top:10px;max-width:52ch;font-size:15px;line-height:1.6;color:#93a099;font-weight:300\">Preto integral, placa rígida e Air Zoom aparecendo no antepé.<\u002Fp>\n        <\u002Fdiv>\n        <a href=\"https://wa.me/5538997506508?text=Oi%21%20Quero%20saber%20sobre%20o%20Nike%20Air%20Zoom%20Alphafly%203.\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:9px;min-height:46px;padding:0 22px;border-radius:999px;border:1px solid rgba(238,242,238,.22);color:#eef2ee;font-size:14px;transition:border-color .3s ease,background .3s ease\" style-hover=\"border-color:#4fb98d;background:rgba(79,185,141,.1);color:#eef2ee\">Consultar no WhatsApp <span style=\"color:#4fb98d\">→<\u002Fspan><\u002Fa>\n      <\u002Fdiv>\n    <\u002Farticle>\n\n    <article class=\"mf-reveal\" style=\"display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(360px,1fr));gap:clamp(18px,3vw,44px);align-items:center\">\n      <div style=\"position:relative;overflow:hidden;border-radius:4px;background:#101512;aspect-ratio:4/3\">\n        <img src=\"630a5222-0fa8-44e7-9a63-f14ee3bd934d\" alt=\"Nike Air VaporMax Plus em degradê azul e laranja segurado na mão\" loading=\"lazy\" style=\"width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover;object-position:50% 44%;transition:transform 1.4s cubic-bezier(.16,1,.3,1)\" style-hover=\"transform:scale(1.04)\">\n      <\u002Fdiv>\n      <div style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;align-items:flex-end;justify-content:space-between;gap:20px\">\n        <div>\n          <span style=\"font-family:'Space Mono',monospace;font-size:11px;letter-spacing:.18em;color:#5f6f66\">002<\u002Fspan>\n          <h3 style=\"margin-top:8px;font-famil